  "id": "rawblock",
  "name": "RawBlock Design System",
  "description": "RawBlock is an unapologetic, anti-design system that strips interfaces down to their structural bones. Built for experimental portfolios and avant-garde art sites, it embraces thick borders, system-level aesthetics, and the raw power of black-on-white. There are no rounded corners, no shadows, no polish. Every element looks like it was assembled from HTML primitives -- because that is the point. T",
